      "widgets_values": [
        "# DramaBox Narrator Options\n\nDramaBox supports:\n\n- an empty narrator for reference-free generation\n- directly connected narrator audio\n- voices supplied through the `🎭 Character Voices` node\n\nDramaBox uses only the reference audio. It does **not** use or require a reference transcription.\n\nIf needed, use the `🎭 Character Voices` node to trim the reference audio before sending it to DramaBox."
      ],
